# Security response headers for Netlify / Cloudflare Pages (and similar).
# These apply to every page. They are safe for this static site.
# (If you deploy on Apache / cPanel instead, use the .htaccess file and
#  delete this one. If you use GitHub Pages, neither works there.)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
# Turn the next line on only once your site is served fully over HTTPS:
#  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
